#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-SD0041 expect=skipped domain=CM
#note "Rule round 2026-10-12 (owner, verdict 2-1'): --PRESP moved from the authored `not var_exists(\"--PRESP\") or` disjunct to Requirements.Variables.All. No CMPRESP column at all -> the rule SKIPS; PMDA-SD1147 reports the absent --PRESP once for the dataset (--OCCUR present). Before the round row 1 (OCCUR populated) fired per record - this file pinned that as a violation."
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-4
dataset CM class=INTERVENTIONS label="Concomitant Medications"
col STUDYID  type=Char
col DOMAIN   type=Char
col USUBJID  type=Char
col CMSEQ    type=Num
col CMTRT    type=Char
col CMOCCUR  type=Char
---
S1 | CM | 001 | 1 | ASPIRIN   | Y
S1 | CM | 001 | 2 | IBUPROFEN |
